    {
      "id": "4090853601",
      "type": "product",
      "title": "sparrow bag!!!",
      "subtitle_html": " <span class=\"js-product-sku notranslate\" translate=\"no\">\npin and carabiner not included — they’re mine! :,3\n</span> ",
      "price": "150",
      "currency": "€",
      "description_html": "“the birds are seeking the sun, carrying flowers and songs”✨<br/><br/>This phrase is like a little title for everything I make. The birds came from a song, and the idea that a world without flowers and songs would slowly lose its mind came from a story that has stayed with me.<br/>To me, “flowers and songs” are the small joyful things that keep the earth alive: creativity, love, gentleness, and the things we make for each other. They are what protect the world from going mad.<br/>The birds searching for the sun are people like me — travelers looking for their own light, their own home, and the sun inside themselves. And the flowers and songs are what I try to give to the world along the way.<br/>I hope this bag carries a little of that with you too💛<br/><br/>Please note: the phrase is written in my native language, because it is a story about me. But if you’d like, I can embroider a different phrase for you — your own little reminder to keep close<br/><br/>",
      "button": {
        "label": "adopt",
        "href": "@bluesky"
      },
